# Silvan Reveler: "Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, you may pay {1}{G}{U}. If you do, return this card from your
# graveyard to your hand." Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Reveler on turn 2; Bot2 then plays a Mountain, which is not a land Bot1
# controls, so nothing triggers. On turn 3 Bot1 plays a Forest: the ability triggers from the graveyard, Bot1 pays {1}{G}{U} (its
# Mox Emerald, Mox Sapphire and Mox Jet) and the Reveler returns to Bot1's hand - not to the battlefield.

